{"blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "小津じゃーん！！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202607/mobXOJCK7.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "こんにちは！こんばんは！\n小津玲奈です"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "7月4日、5日"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "北海道公演\nありがとうございました！！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "なんといっても！\n北海道公演では"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "6期生楽曲「命の色」"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "を初披露させていただきました"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "命について歌う壮大な世界観ではありながら\n泥臭く生きることを肯定してくれる、\n一人一人の心にまっすぐ響く\n楽曲となっています"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ダンスもジャズダンスや\nコンテンポラリーのような要素が多く、"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "私自身、高校時代ダンス部で\nジャズやコンテンポラリー系の創作ダンスを\n練習していたので"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "命の色は踊っていて\nとても心躍る楽曲です"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "6期生の力強いパフォーマンスが\n皆さんの心にまっすぐ\n届くことを願っています"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "↓ぜひお聴きください↓"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "https://nogizaka46.lnk.to/inochinoiro"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "北海道では、、、\nとにかく美味しいものを\nたくさん食べました！！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "海鮮丼にスープカレー、\nザンギにジンギスカン！！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "カレーが好きで有名な小津ですが\n（もちろんご存知ですよね？？？）"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "なんと人生で初めて\nスープカレーを食べたの！！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "具沢山でおいしかった〜🍛"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "いつか北海道観光もしたいなぁ〜"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "歴史が好きなれいな博士は\nゴールデンカムイが大好き💕"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "五稜郭での戦い🏯"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "痺れますよね〜〜"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "五稜郭がなぜ星型なのか⭐️"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "星型のトゲトゲを作ることで死角がなくなり\nどこから攻められても多方向からの攻撃を\n浴びせられる最強の防衛構造となるからです"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "おしゃれで強いってなまら素敵！！！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "北海道公演では\n先輩方とお話しできることも多かったの！！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "2日目にね、\n「彩ちゃん」さんとツインテールを\nお揃いに！！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "「小川さんのツインテールがみたいです！」"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "とお願いしたら、"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "「小津ちゃんとお揃いでやりたい！」"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "と言ってくださって\n実現した奇跡の髪型です👧"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ついに彩ちゃん呼びにも挑戦！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "今後私はご本人を前にして\n彩ちゃんと呼べるのか、、、"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "乞うご期待です"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "さらにさらに\n控室で席が近かった林さんと\nお写真を撮っていただいたの📷"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202607/mobCNK6Mt.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ぴよこちゃんも持たせてもらえて\n嬉しかった〜🐣"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "嬉しさが顔から滲み出ていて\nニヤニヤしているのがバレちゃう🫣"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "初めてのことがたくさんのツアー期間\nとっても楽しませてもらっています"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "皆さんからのでっかい愛にお応えできるよう\nもっともっと\nでっかくなってやるからなーーー！！！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "いつもありがどうーーーー！！！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ーーーーーーーーーーーーーーーーーーーーーーーー"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "お久しぶりのクイズのお時間です"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "その地域の特産品をたくさん調べて、\nご当地のお土産を買うことが大好きな私"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "北海道では合計何個のお土産を\n買ったでしょうか？？\n（一口分のお菓子やおつまみも含めているよ）"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ヒントは「ほっかいどう」"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "全部で画数はいくつ？？？"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "私のお年玉はもうすっからかんです、、😭"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "広島公演もよろしくお願いします🍁"}], "source": "official"}